cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its figures, please cite the paper below."
title: "weekday-manifold: sensitivity and occupancy tests for representation manifolds"
abstract: >-
  Code for every figure and quoted number of "Spokes, not a Ring:
  Revisiting the Weekday Manifold in Language Models". Measures steering sensitivity,
  time-of-day and uncertainty encodings, and natural-text occupancy on the
  days-of-the-week manifold in Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.1 and GPT-2 XL, and
  finds seven discrete states rather than a continuous ring.
type: software
